 (p_{\rm f},v_{\rm f},a_{\rm f},m_{\rm f})=(p,v,a,m)(\alpha_{\rm f},1),\qquad d_{\rm f}=d(\alpha_{\rm f},1).
 \tag{32.6}
$$
